Hi Lucas,

Yes, you can do it that way. Or you can use the confint method like this:
library(unmarked)
example(unmarked)
confint(fm2, type="state")

If you want profile likelihood based CIs, you can do:
confint(fm2, type="state", method="profile")

Richard
